That's nothing... I had a level 13 Samurai on the Medusa level, drink
a potion of levitation and get stranded on an island.

He thouht... no problem! He just put on his ring of polymorph,
and waited for the black dragon scale mail to kick in....

He had a wand of cold with a couple shots left, if that wouldn't
work far enough...

An electric eel came up and destroyed both the ring of polymorph
and the wand of cold in short order, as well as a couple unidentified
wands (and one thing that really disappointed me was that unlike
the stuff that survived, I'll never know what they were).

I killed the eel, and realized I was probably stuck on this island
for the remainder of my character's natural life. Then I pulled out
of Ye Olde Bag of Holding a wand of create monster.

I figured I could possibly create some monsters, and maybe one of
them would have something useful (scroll of teleport, amulet of magical
breathing, boots/ring of levitation... I was desperate).

I summoned a mind flayer with the thing. It wasn't pleasant, because of
my stupid plain orcish helm.... 

The dying message was: "Died of brainlessness."

Nice touch.

